  "speakers": {
    "bram": "Elder Bram"
  },
  "nodes": {
    "welcome": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "So you are the one the old farmstead was left to. Welcome to Hearthvale. It lies out the west lane, past the last cottage: run down and overgrown, but the house stands and the soil is good.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "What should I do first?",
          "next": "settle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "settle": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Settle in. Take the tools by your door, till a patch and put a seed in it. Tilda sells more seed in the red house. Come and see me when your first crop is in the ground.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "greet": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Ah, come in, come in. Have you seen the lights over the old keep at night?",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Your supper, Elder.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "quest_stage",
              "quest": "elders_supper",
              "stage": "cook"
            },
            {
              "type": "has_item",
              "item": "vegetable_stew",
              "count": 1
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "take_item",
              "item": "vegetable_stew",
              "count": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "elders_supper_given",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "next": "favour_done"
        },
        {
          "text": "About that stew...",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "quest_stage",
              "quest": "elders_supper",
              "stage": "cook"
            }
          ],
          "next": "favour_hint"
        },
        {
          "text": "What lights?",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "promised_elder_keep",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "keep_warden_beaten",
              "value": false
            }
          ],
          "next": "lights"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm keeping watch, as I promised.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "promised_elder_keep",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "keep_warden_beaten",
              "value": false
            }
          ],
          "next": "kept"
        },
        {
          "text": "The keep is quiet. The Warden fell.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "keep_warden_beaten",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "crypt_shade_beaten",
              "value": false
            }
          ],
          "next": "tale"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Shade is gone.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "flag": "crypt_shade_beaten",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "next": "ended"
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "lights": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Something has stirred in the keep north of here. Someone sharp-eyed ought to keep watch.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll keep watch.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "promised_elder_keep",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "keep_gate_open",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "next": "promise"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not me.",
          "next": "refused"
        }
      ]
    },
    "promise": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Bless you. I will have the chain taken off the keep's gate. Take the old wooden sword from the training yard, then go north past the chapel, through the fields and the Old Wood.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "refused": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Hm. Think on it.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "kept": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Good. I sleep easier for it. The gate is unchained. The road north past the chapel leads through the fields and the Old Wood to the keep.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "tale": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Then the old tale is true, and I sent you to break a lock. Long ago Sir Aldric bound a Shade under our chapel, and set the Warden to watch it. With the Warden fallen, the bars will not hold past dawn.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "What now?",
          "next": "tale_next"
        }
      ]
    },
    "tale_next": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Finish what Aldric began. It is dark down there, so find a light before you go deep. They say his sword still lies in his tomb.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "ended": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Gone? Then Hearthvale can sleep, and there will be no more lights over the keep. You have done what Aldric could not. We will not forget it.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "present": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "The village keeps a little by for those who look after it. Forty coins, and my thanks with them.",
      "on_enter": [
        {
          "type": "give_item",
          "item": "coin",
          "count": 40
        },
        {
          "type": "set_flag",
          "flag": "present/elder_bram",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you, Elder.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "favour": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "You have been kind to an old man. One thing more: my own cooking is poor, and I miss a proper vegetable stew. Bring me one, and I'll tell you what I know of Sir Aldric.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll cook you one.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_quest_stage",
              "quest": "elders_supper",
              "stage": "cook"
            }
          ],
          "next": "favour_go"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not just now.",
          "next": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "favour_go": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "A potato, a carrot and a turnip, as my mother made it.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "favour_hint": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "A vegetable stew: a potato, a carrot and a turnip, cooked at your hearth.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "favour_done": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "Ah, that is the taste. Sit. Sir Aldric was no lord's son. He was born in this valley, and before he took up the sword he farmed, as you do.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Go on.",
          "next": "favour_tale"
        }
      ]
    },
    "favour_tale": {
      "speaker": "bram",
      "text": "They say the farm you keep was his. He left it for whoever would look after the valley. I think it has found its keeper.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
